Package: basecoat
Title: Beautiful User Interfaces via 'Basecoat UI'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josiah", "Parry", , "josiah.parry@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Ronan", "Berder", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Author of the bundled basecoat-css library")
  )
Description: Create beautiful user interfaces through 'Basecoat UI'
    components.  Basecoat is a pure-'Tailwind' implementation of
    'shadcn/ui' without any 'React'.  The package is built on 'htmltools'
    and designed to work with all UI frameworks with a custom 'shiny'
    integration to boot.  'CSS' and 'JavaScript' dependencies are included
    in the package and no content delivery network (CDN) is used.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://ricochet-rs.github.io/basecoat/, https://basecoatui.com
Imports:
    cli,
    htmltools (>= 0.5.4),
    rlang (>= 1.1.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/Needs/website: commonmark, downlit, knitr, xml2, yaml, yyjsonr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0.9000
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
